{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0396-s001", "text": "I Finland är det vanligt att begravningar ordnas först flera veckor efter ett dödsfall.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061454295799Z/hb-c09-u0396-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.324615478515625, "generation_seconds": 31.11991585791111, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0396-s002", "text": "Det tar tid att ta hand om alla praktiska arrangemang och ordna med begravningen, och dessutom kan det vara rusning på begravningsplatserna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061454295799Z/hb-c09-u0396-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.702857142857143, "peak": 0.458038330078125, "generation_seconds": 48.67833084287122, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0396-s003", "text": "Den avlidne, det vill säga den som dött, kan dock begravas också snabbare, om dödsorsaken har utretts och en läkare har gett begravningstillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061454295799Z/hb-c09-u0396-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.120816326530612, "peak": 0.408935546875, "generation_seconds": 43.95278114103712, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0397-s001", "text": "Var och en får ordna en sådan begravning som den vill för den anhörige, men i mån av möjlighet ska den avlidnes önskemål uppfyllas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061454295799Z/hb-c09-u0397-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.936598639455783, "peak": 0.296356201171875, "generation_seconds": 36.37875428493135, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0397-s002", "text": "Människor som hör till olika religioner har olika begravningstraditioner.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061454295799Z/hb-c09-u0397-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.277740478515625, "generation_seconds": 17.981586846988648, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0397-s003", "text": "I Finland finns det många olika begravningsbyråer som erbjuder hjälp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061454295799Z/hb-c09-u0397-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.299224853515625, "generation_seconds": 17.899624781915918, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0397-s004", "text": "Begravningsbyråer är företag som ordnar begravningar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061454295799Z/hb-c09-u0397-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.346527099609375, "generation_seconds": 13.382808692054823, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0397-s005", "text": "Man kan också själv ordna begravningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061454295799Z/hb-c09-u0397-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.268341064453125, "generation_seconds": 12.828098733210936, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0398-s001", "text": "I Finland bestämmer den avlidne själv eller familjen vad som ska hända med kroppen efter döden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061912786290Z/hb-c09-u0398-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.27423095703125, "generation_seconds": 24.08844254887663, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0398-s002", "text": "Den avlidne kan begravas i en kista eller så kan kroppen brännas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061912786290Z/hb-c09-u0398-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.31005859375, "generation_seconds": 16.796301265014336, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0398-s003", "text": "Kistbegravningar är vanliga i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061912786290Z/hb-c09-u0398-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.27386474609375, "generation_seconds": 13.60373603203334, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0398-s004", "text": "I en kista får en människa begravas endast på begravningsplatser som har behörigt tillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061912786290Z/hb-c09-u0398-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.3189697265625, "generation_seconds": 22.93613460403867, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0399-s001", "text": "Kremering har blivit vanligare de senaste årtiondena.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061912786290Z/hb-c09-u0399-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.26812744140625, "generation_seconds": 16.006649046903476, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0399-s002", "text": "Det är det förmånligaste begravningssättet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061912786290Z/hb-c09-u0399-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.280487060546875, "generation_seconds": 18.10074604093097, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0399-s003", "text": "När den avlidne har kremerats, förs askan i ett särskilt kärl, en askurna, till en begravningsplats för att begravas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061912786290Z/hb-c09-u0399-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.384002685546875, "generation_seconds": 40.86811242997646, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0399-s004", "text": "På begravningsplatser finns ett särskilt område, en urnlund, där urnan kan begravas eller askan spridas på marken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T061912786290Z/hb-c09-u0399-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.822040816326531, "peak": 0.37652587890625, "generation_seconds": 37.458306543994695, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0400-s001", "text": "Om den avlidne eller den avlidnes familj vill kan askan också spridas någon annanstans, till exempel på familjens egen mark eller i havet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062255360386Z/hb-c09-u0400-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.77251700680272, "peak": 0.321990966796875, "generation_seconds": 38.66844974504784, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0400-s002", "text": "Om familjen vill sprida askan på någon annans mark eller vattenområde, måste man be om tillstånd av den som äger marken eller vattenområdet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062255360386Z/hb-c09-u0400-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.051156462585034, "peak": 0.4930419921875, "generation_seconds": 38.63662197813392, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0400-s003", "text": "All aska måste dessutom spridas på ett och samma ställe, man får med andra ord inte dela på den.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062255360386Z/hb-c09-u0400-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.3665771484375, "generation_seconds": 25.325344417942688, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0401-s001", "text": "I Finland är majoriteten av begravningsplatserna begravningsplatser som upprätthålls av den evangelisk-lutherska kyrkan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062255360386Z/hb-c09-u0401-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.866938775510205, "peak": 0.321533203125, "generation_seconds": 35.81345584685914, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0401-s002", "text": "På dem får dock också personer som hör till andra trossamfund begravas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062255360386Z/hb-c09-u0401-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.361328125, "generation_seconds": 20.330739527009428, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0401-s003", "text": "På de flesta begravningsplatser finns det separata områden för avlidna som har varit medlemmar i något annat trossamfund eller inte varit medlemmar i något samfund alls.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062255360386Z/hb-c09-u0401-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.931972789115646, "peak": 0.314544677734375, "generation_seconds": 40.48716753278859, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0402-s001", "text": "Kommunerna kan också ha egna begravningsplatser för olika religiösa samfund, till exempel en ortodox, muslimsk eller judisk begravningsplats.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062255360386Z/hb-c09-u0402-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.329795918367347, "peak": 0.340972900390625, "generation_seconds": 41.016810892149806, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0402-s002", "text": "Olika religiösa eller icke-religiösa samfund kan ha egna privata begravningsplatser.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062255360386Z/hb-c09-u0402-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.322052001953125, "generation_seconds": 26.514786317944527, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0402-s003", "text": "Det egna religiösa samfundet eller begravningsbyråerna ger information om begravningsplatser och de praktiska arrangemangen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062804688063Z/hb-c09-u0402-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.518639455782314, "peak": 0.31744384765625, "generation_seconds": 31.524108825949952, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0403-s001", "text": "Om en utlänning avlider i Finland och familjen vill transportera den avlidnes kropp eller aska till ett annat land för att begravas, ska de kontakta destinationslandets ambassad i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062804688063Z/hb-c09-u0403-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.952108843537415, "peak": 0.4219970703125, "generation_seconds": 45.93299683602527, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0403-s002", "text": "En del länders ambassader hjälper familjer att transportera avlidna anhöriga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062804688063Z/hb-c09-u0403-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.312286376953125, "generation_seconds": 23.01193930883892, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0403-s003", "text": "Familjen betalar själv transporten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062804688063Z/hb-c09-u0403-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.35662841796875, "generation_seconds": 10.899702631868422, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0404-s001", "text": "När en närstående person avlider, kan du få hjälp och stöd i sorgen vid social- och hälsocentralen (sosiaali- ja terveyskeskus) eller familjerådgivningen (perheneuvola) i ditt område, i MIELI ry:s kristelefon eller hos församlingarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062804688063Z/hb-c09-u0404-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 20.410340136054423, "peak": 0.35540771484375, "generation_seconds": 61.43562855105847, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0405-s001", "text": "Du får hjälp på finska och svenska och på de flesta ställena även på engelska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062804688063Z/hb-c09-u0405-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.288848876953125, "generation_seconds": 19.860401357058436, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0405-s002", "text": "Du kan även ta hjälp av en tolk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062804688063Z/hb-c09-u0405-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.2043537414965986, "peak": 0.30975341796875, "generation_seconds": 10.078998067881912, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0405-s003", "text": "Mieli ry:s kristelefon betjänar på finska, svenska, engelska, ukrainska och ryska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T062804688063Z/hb-c09-u0405-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.450225830078125, "generation_seconds": 22.206707762088627, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0406-s001", "text": "När en person som är medborgare i något annat land avlider i Finland utreds dödsorsaken enligt finsk lag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063224502718Z/hb-c09-u0406-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.275360107421875, "generation_seconds": 30.49447891791351, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0406-s002", "text": "En myndighet eller ett sjukhus anmäler dödsfallet till beskickningen i den avlidnes ursprungsland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063224502718Z/hb-c09-u0406-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.35479736328125, "generation_seconds": 26.722051368793473, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0406-s003", "text": "Beskickningen eller utrikesministeriet i den avlidnes ursprungsland meddelar informationen till den avlidnes närstående.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063224502718Z/hb-c09-u0406-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.2664794921875, "generation_seconds": 35.215301326010376, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0407-s001", "text": "Om ingen nära anhörig ser till att den avlidna personen blir begraven, kremerad eller transporterad till hemlandet kan beskickningen kontakta de lokala myndigheterna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063224502718Z/hb-c09-u0407-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.722993197278912, "peak": 0.316070556640625, "generation_seconds": 47.58755330997519, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0407-s002", "text": "I detta fall begravs eller kremeras kroppen enligt finsk praxis.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063224502718Z/hb-c09-u0407-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.2852783203125, "generation_seconds": 17.895180009072646, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0408-s001", "text": "Ibland kan en avliden person ha rätt till begravningsbidrag baserat på sin sista anställning eller sitt medlemskap i ett fackförbund.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063224502718Z/hb-c09-u0408-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.215238095238096, "peak": 0.330078125, "generation_seconds": 25.00366491219029, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0408-s002", "text": "Fråga den sista arbetsgivaren eller fackförbundet om detta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063224502718Z/hb-c09-u0408-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.376007080078125, "generation_seconds": 11.600527143105865, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0408-s003", "text": "För begravningskostnaderna för en medellös person kan du ansöka om utkomststöd (toimeentulotuki) hos FPA och socialtjänsterna i ditt område.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063224502718Z/hb-c09-u0408-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.817414965986394, "peak": 0.26019287109375, "generation_seconds": 23.508154958020896, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0409-s001", "text": "Efter en persons bortgång kan maka/make och barn få familjepension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063636265109Z/hb-c09-u0409-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.281341552734375, "generation_seconds": 11.2218340060208, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0409-s002", "text": "Syftet med familjepensionen är att trygga änkans/änklingens och barnens uppehälle.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063636265109Z/hb-c09-u0409-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.33795166015625, "generation_seconds": 17.1025833778549, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0409-s003", "text": "I Finland finns två olika familjepensioner: FPA:s familjepension och familjepensionen från arbetspensionssystemet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063636265109Z/hb-c09-u0409-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.563537414965987, "peak": 0.31561279296875, "generation_seconds": 35.25814114813693, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0409-s004", "text": "Om den avlidna har arbetat som anställd eller företagare i Finland kan änkan/änklingen och barnen få familjepension från arbetspensionssystemet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063636265109Z/hb-c09-u0409-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.399455782312925, "peak": 0.33245849609375, "generation_seconds": 30.74118653894402, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0410-s001", "text": "Om en person har bott eller arbetat länge i ett annat land innan hen flyttade till Finland kan änkan/änklingen och barnen ha rätt till familjepension även från detta land.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063636265109Z/hb-c09-u0410-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.001632653061224, "peak": 0.50384521484375, "generation_seconds": 33.96420472790487, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0410-s002", "text": "Ta reda på villkoren för familjepension från Finland eller ursprungslandet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-begravning/narration-resume-20261103T063636265109Z/hb-c09-u0410-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.27435302734375, "generation_seconds": 16.170504498993978, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
